    "# Review 2 — Classification Part B\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** Steel Plates Faults. This notebook focuses on the five **Part B (Review 2)** algorithms: Random Forest, AdaBoost, Gradient Boosting, Bagging with a Decision Tree base estimator, and MLP Neural Network.\n",
    "\n",
    "The five **Part A (Review 1)** algorithms are rerun only because the Review 2 rubric requires one consolidated comparison table covering all ten algorithms on the same dataset and split."
   ]
  },
