   "source": [
    "## 4. Stratified split and preprocessing\n",
    "All models use the same 80:20 stratified split. Median imputation and scaling are fitted only on training data through a Pipeline. Scaling is useful for distance- and gradient-based models."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "5bf13258",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Train: (1552, 27) Test: (389, 27)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "X_train,X_test,y_train,y_test=train_test_split(X,y,test_size=0.2,random_state=RANDOM_STATE,stratify=y)\n",
    "print('Train:',X_train.shape,'Test:',X_test.shape)\n",
    "def pipe(est):\n",
    "    return Pipeline([('imputer',SimpleImputer(strategy='median')),('scaler',StandardScaler()),('model',est)])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "974111b2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Required algorithms — Review 2 focus\n",
    "**Part B (Review 2 — main focus):** Random Forest, AdaBoost, Gradient Boosting, Bagging with a Decision Tree base estimator, and MLP Neural Network.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Part A (Review 1 — comparison only):** Logistic Regression, KNN, Gaussian Naive Bayes, Decision Tree, and SVC. These are rerun only to satisfy the required consolidated 10-algorithm comparison."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "56555891",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Models: 10\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "models={\n",
    "'Logistic Regression':pipe(LogisticRegression(max_iter=2000,class_weight='balanced',random_state=42)),\n",
    "'KNN':pipe(KNeighborsClassifier(n_neighbors=5)),\n",
    "'Gaussian Naive Bayes':pipe(GaussianNB()),\n",
    "'Decision Tree':pipe(DecisionTreeClassifier(class_weight='balanced',random_state=42)),\n",
    "'SVC':pipe(SVC(C=1,kernel='rbf',probability=True,class_weight='balanced',random_state=42)),\n",
    "'Random Forest':pipe(RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=200,class_weight='balanced',random_state=42,n_jobs=-1)),\n",
    "'AdaBoost':pipe(AdaBoostClassifier(n_estimators=100,learning_rate=0.5,random_state=42)),\n",
    "'Gradient Boosting':pipe(GradientBoostingClassifier(n_estimators=100,learning_rate=0.05,random_state=42)),\n",
    "'Bagging (Decision Tree)':pipe(BaggingClassifier(estimator=DecisionTreeClassifier(random_state=42),n_estimators=100,random_state=42,n_jobs=-1)),\n",
    "'MLP Neural Network':pipe(MLPClassifier(hidden_layer_sizes=(100,50),activation='relu',max_iter=500,early_stopping=True,random_state=42))}\n",
    "print('Models:',len(models))"
   ]
  },
